[E0436] Error: `token.id` is used after `slot`, which it refers to, was changed
    ╭─[ err/84_guard_borrows/main.wip:21:16 ]
    │
 17 │         val .Some(token) = slot else {
    │                   ──┬──
    │                     ╰──── `token` refers to `slot`
    │
 20 │         slot = .None
    │         ──┬─
    │           ╰─── `slot` assigned here
 21 │         assert(token.id == 1)
    │                ────┬───
    │                    ╰───── used here
    │
    │ Help: use `token.id` before `slot` changes, or take what is needed from it before then
    │
    │ Note: a binding of a pattern on a place refers to the place, so the place must not change while the binding is still used
────╯
